      <description align="left" color="yellow" colored="false" height="130" width="1020" x="30" y="260">Run nine actual generated AutoModel templates sequentially with unique operator/memory namespaces. All use the full prepared1048575-row CSV, a30k initial modeling sample with local2001, main60/40 split1992, specialCOMMON_ROW_ID, and full-holdout metrics. Existing native robust7 evaluation is retained but supplemental. Original saved nine-model processes/models are not overwritten. Verify exported row-ID/label membership across allnine before accepting comparisons.</description>
